      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Montaria. Até pouco tempo, moradores das montanhas montavam em Skiddo para atravessar trilhas. Desde que tenha água e luz solar, ele produz energia pelas folhas do corpo e consegue viver em terrenos rochosos sem alimento.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Skiddo pode evoluir para Gogoat no nível 11 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growth, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Tail Whip, Vine Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Leech Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Razor Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Worry Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Synthesis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Bulldoze</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Seed Bomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Bulk Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Double-Edge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Horn Leech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Leaf Blade, Milk Drink</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Body Slam, Brick Break, Bulk Up, Bulldoze, Bullet Seed, Confide, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Endeavor, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Tail, Leaf Storm, Magical Leaf, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Nature Power, Payback, Play Rough, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Roar, Rock Slide, Round, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Stomping Tantrum, Substitute, Sunny Day, Surf, Swagger, Synthesis, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze, Wild Charge, Work Up, Worry Seed, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Defense Curl, Grassy Terrain, Milk Drink, Rollout</p>",
